---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import InquiryForm from '../components/InquiryForm.astro';
const ld = {
 "@context": "https://schema.org",
 "@type": "ContactPage",
 "url": "https://lvgwildlifesolutions.com/contact",
 "name": "Contact LVG Wildlife Solutions",
 "mainEntity": {
  "@id": "https://lvgwildlifesolutions.com/#business",
  "@type": "ProfessionalService",
  "name": "LVG Wildlife Solutions",
  "alternateName": "Land Value Group Wildlife Solutions",
  "areaServed": [
   {
    "@type": "State",
    "name": "Texas"
   }
  ]
 }
};
---
<Base
  title={"Request a Property Assessment | LVG Wildlife Solutions"}
  description={"Request a wildlife property assessment in North and East Texas. Tell us about your land and what you want from it. We reply within a couple of days."}
  path="/contact"
  ogTitle={"Contact LVG Wildlife Solutions"}
  ogDescription={"Tell us about your property. Assessments, wildlife management plans, and habitat management across North and East Texas."}
  robots="index,follow,max-image-preview:large"
  current="contact"
  ld={ld}
  mcta={{"title": "Property assessment", "line": "We reply within a couple of days", "href": "#name", "label": "Start the form"}}
>
<!-- ===================== PAGE HEAD ===================== -->
<section class="dark topo-gold deep pagehead">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="idx"><i></i><s></s><b>START WITH YOUR LAND</b></div>
    <h1>Let's take a look at your land</h1>
    <p class="lead">You don't need anything figured out first. Most folks reach out because something isn't working and they're not sure why, or because they want a plan they can file for the Texas wildlife exemption. Either way, start here.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===================== FORM ===================== -->
<section class="topo-ink shift-2 seam">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cgrid">
      <div>
        <h2 class="h2s">What happens after you reach out</h2>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>A real person reads every inquiry, and you'll hear back within a couple of days, usually sooner. The first call is us learning your property and what you want out of it. No pressure, no sales pitch.</p>
          <p>From there we get a visit on the calendar and send you a short intake form so the time we spend on the ground counts for something. Every property we take on is a partnership. You know this place better than anyone; we know what to look for.</p>
          <p>If the Texas wildlife tax exemption is one of your goals, say so and we will factor it in from the start.</p>
          <p>You are welcome to read <a href='/property-assessment'>what the assessment covers</a>, <a href='/wildlife-tax-valuation'>how the wildlife tax exemption works</a>, or the <a href='/faq'>common questions</a> first.</p>
        </div>

        <h2 class="h2s" style="margin-top:2.25rem">Where we work</h2>
        <dl class="direct">
          <div><dt>Service area</dt><dd>North and East Texas</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>

      <InquiryForm source="contact page" tenure />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</Base>
